cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "MicaSense Radiometric Correction"
abstract: >-
  Converts raw images of MicaSense multispectral cameras into reflectance, or into radiance, using the reference panel
  and, optionally, the Downwelling Light Sensor (DLS) data, through a user interface, a workflow runner or a Python
  library. Tested with the RedEdge-P.
authors:
